1
00:00:00,094 --> 00:00:02,094
(Alfred:)How is everyone today?

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:03,096
(Beverley:)Good, and you?

3
00:00:03,097 --> 00:00:05,177
(Alfred:)Good, good.
Good.

4
00:00:05,182 --> 00:00:06,552
(Mary:)I'm good, too.

5
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,430
(Randall (Penny's brother):)Good.

6
00:00:11,222 --> 00:00:13,442
(Sheldon:)So, did you defile
my mother or not?

7
00:00:14,392 --> 00:00:16,942
Sheldon!

8
00:00:16,944 --> 00:00:19,024
(Mary:)You're being rude.

9
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,450
(Alfred:)If I may, I can assure you,

10
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:21,898
(Alfred:)your mother and I
did nothing more

11
00:00:21,899 --> 00:00:24,119
(Alfred:)than share a cab
and a conversation.

12
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:26,288
(Sheldon:)Did that conversation
include the phrase

13
00:00:26,287 --> 00:00:28,457
"your genitals
are a joy to behold"?

14
00:00:28,456 --> 00:00:30,656
That's enough!

15
00:00:30,658 --> 00:00:35,628
(Alfred:)Look, I promise you, neither I,
nor anyone, has ever said that.

16
00:00:35,629 --> 00:00:40,299
(Leonard:)You don't know his girlfriend
very well.

17
00:00:40,301 --> 00:00:43,421
(Sheldon:)Or what a joy it is
to behold my genitals.

18
00:00:45,589 --> 00:00:48,089
(Penny:)All right, you guys, uh,
get settled in,

19
00:00:48,092 --> 00:00:50,342
(Penny:)then we'll go across the hall
and say hi to everyone.

20
00:00:50,344 --> 00:00:52,814
(Randall:)You know, It's hard to believe
I've never met Leonard.

21
00:00:52,813 --> 00:00:55,093
(Wyatt:)Well, he probably buys
his illegal drugs

22
00:00:55,099 --> 00:00:56,269
(Wyatt:)from a local vendor.

23
00:00:57,685 --> 00:00:59,235
(Susan:)Not funny, Wyatt.

24
00:00:59,236 --> 00:01:01,766
(Penny:)I thought it was really funny.
Thanks.

